selection.bgColor uses bgColor.accent.emphasis at 0.2 alpha in light mode and
0.7 alpha in dark mode. control.checked.bgColor.rest uses the same accent.
Code copy uses fgColor.muted, the Markdown secondary text token. Mermaid uses
the existing reading palette's canvas, surface, foreground and border roles;
this is a native diagram mapping, not a copy of GitHub's Mermaid stylesheet.

